{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"レコ大わずー(・∀・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB４８さん!!!おめでとうございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂はライバル、ライバルって呼んでいただいてますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライバルの存在の大きさを改めて感じましたー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、ひめたん今日はレッスン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日はいこまっち(生駒里奈chan)のお誕生会(・∀・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ふぁんのみなさんの分までしっかりお祝いしてきたのでご安心を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんいっつもみんなのお誕生会のとき広島にいて参加できんけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はよかったよかった!うれしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳だってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/birthday.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいねお姉さんぢゃね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。はぴば!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい衣装着たー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながらまだみなさんにお見せできません('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちょい、もーちょいだけ待っとってねー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年のお楽しみってことで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","