graph","text":"会えなすぎて病気になっちゃうんんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいかな？対処方法を教えてよ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほえーいつになるんぢゃろ('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんに会いたい病はひめたんに会わないと治らんよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぢゃお薬として、毎日ブログ遊びに来てくださーい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこでお話ししましょうよ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病状悪化するかな('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはチャレンジしてみたい髪型とかあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっアリスになってみたいー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、広島弁無理して使ってる？普通でいいのに(ToT)ちょっと不自然なような…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全っ然無理してないですよー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、文字にしちゃうとちょっと読みにくいかなーと最近思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかし、よくメンバーの家に泊まりに行くなー！さすがは甘えん坊ひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何？ホテルじゃつまらないからつい泊まりに行っちゃうの？"}